cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use nnstab in your research, please cite the papers below (the preferred citation and the reference)."
type: software
title: "nnstab: stability of positive feedback systems with a neural network controller"
abstract: "Python and MATLAB library that verifies the exponential stability of positive feedback systems with a neural network controller and finds the largest certified region of attraction, with Metzler and Hurwitz tests and no semidefinite programming. It uses sector bounds from nnsector."
authors:
  - family-names: "Montazeri Hedesh"
    given-names: "Hamidreza"
